The '''2024–25 season''' was the 42nd season in the history of '''[[Getafe CF|Getafe Club de Fútbol]]''', and the club's eighth consecutive season in [[La Liga]]. In addition to the [[2024–25 La Liga|domestic league]], the club participated in the [[2024–25 Copa del Rey|Copa del Rey]].

